{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20265sHHSsrSSr1793068831.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地上月規模以上工業利潤按年增長百分之14.4。</p><p></p><p>首九個月累計，規模以上工業利潤按年增長百分之15.5，至60,337億元人民幣。</p><p></p><p>國家統計局工業司首席統計師于衛寧表示，工業生產穩中有進，規模以上工業企業利潤今年以來持續保持雙位數增長。從三大門類看，採礦業利潤增長百分之38.2，製造業利潤增長一成七。電力、熱力、燃氣及水生產和供應業利潤下降百分之14.3。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T03:41:40.624883+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T02:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T08:18:19.307051+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T03:38:28.755497+00:00","content_hash":"4a1d4e520a5cd2770b7b199482d5f2b1eb9852da829a95eeb4f977379f3b4ebc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T03:41:40.624883+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}